[BriefingSubmissions.ATTACK.attack_usa.defend_prk.Mission.Objectives]
Eliminate the enemy's defenses and capture the high point.

[BriefingSubmissions.ATTACK.attack_usa.defend_prk.Mission.Description]
Capture the high point, and eliminate all hostiles. Watch out for your armored vehicles and infantry in the rough mountain terrain. You can use helicopters for reconnaissance purposes.

[BriefingSubmissions.STORM.attack_usa.assault_prk.Mission.Objectives]
Capture the high point.

[BriefingSubmissions.STORM.attack_usa.assault_prk.Mission.Description]
Air reconnaissance has detected what seems to be an enemy advance party. You must capture the high point before the Koreans. Use your helicopters to redeploy your troops quickly.

[BriefingSubmissions.DEFEND.defend_usa.attack_prk.Mission.Objectives]
Repel all enemy attacks.

[BriefingSubmissions.SIEGE.defend_usa.attack_prk.Mission.Objectives]
Repel all enemy attacks.

[BriefingSubmissions.DEFEND.defend_usa.attack_prk.Mission.Description]
Hold the high point at all costs, and repel all enemy attacks. The terrain is difficult, so use mines and close-quarter infantry anti-tank measures.

[BriefingSubmissions.SIEGE.defend_usa.attack_prk.Mission.Description]
Hold the high point at all costs, and repel all enemy attacks. The terrain is difficult, so use mines and close-quarter infantry anti-tank measures.

[BriefingSubmissions.AI_STORM.assault_usa.attack_prk.Mission.Description]
Use helicopters to capture the tactical high point before the enemy reaches it. Then establish your defenses and repel all enemy attacks. Defend the high point for the specified time until the main forces arrive.

